Phone Whisper Android
Copyright 2026 lperezmo

This product is a modified version of Phone Whisper
(https://github.com/kafkasl/phone-whisper), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. The original commit history is preserved in this
repository.

Changes from upstream include: a new application id and package
(com.lperezmo.phonewhisper), release signing, updated Android SDK and build
tooling, a pinned and checksum-verified sherpa-onnx native library fetch, and
subsequent changes recorded in the git history.

This product also bundles sherpa-onnx (https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx)
Kotlin bindings and native libraries, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0, and ONNX Runtime (https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime),
licensed under the MIT License.
